alsify.com/image/upload/s--HuM9in-J--/bf972f7331c7e904549b759f373bf9c7f7c74572.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"The Largest Front Load Washing Capacity*\",\"Copy\":\"*Among front washing machines 28\\\" wide or less\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--7UFDdBZC--/m2qlrkrm58atx4vxt7w3.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Smart Wash & Smart Rinse\",\"Copy\":\"Through AI technology, sensors measure soil and detergent levels throughout the cycle and during the rinse to optimize wash and rinse times, deliver better fabric care and ensure a thorough clean\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--q-6Xac7o--/uubembqv5ekt9kt7jlqp.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"SmartHQ Assistant\",\"Copy\":\"In the SmartHQ App, you can input voice or text commands based off the type of fabric and stains you are washing and SmartHQ Assistant will give you expert recommendations and automatically set your machine for optimal results\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--BKMg9DV_--/qmltnpamwhquvsfiqjv1.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Adaptive SmartDispense\u2122\",\"Copy\":\"Save time and effort with a dispenser that holds enough detergent for up to 32 loads. Plus, scan the barcode on the detergent bottle with the SmartHQ\u2122 app and the washer will dispense the right amount based on the type of detergent.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--qUPIh7T2--/81c08f73de6cddcbda9589dea00d7da346324bbc.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0Jhk_9ZE35E\"},{\"Feature\":\"1 Step Wash + Dry\",\"Copy\":\"Wash and dry a small load in your washer, eliminating the need to transfer clothes to the dryer.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--NURkPwKw--/fc35730ba80653337bdac97ad2722d7136fcca9d.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZrtiXTOVTOE\"},{\"Feature\":\"Smart Features Powered by SmartHQ\u2122\",\"Copy\":\"With SmartHQ\u2122, you can make sure your washer always has the latest features, from extra cycles for jeans and swimwear, to customized stain removal technology for treating up to 30 different stains. It also delivers remote status notifications and enables remote capabilities, so you can easily control and monitor your washer from anywhere.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--tJDO3BO4--/9a3b847c4c3f7b5bd7b9716269771aa71a2b2052.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Quick Wash Cycle\",\"Copy\":\"Provides a fast 20 minute wash for lightly soiled items\"},{\"Feature\":\"Adaptive MySettings\",\"Copy\":\"Through AI Technology, the washer and dryer personalize your cycle selections automatically.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--wxFfGu68--/f4904c9bcb8c8479459fd196c2cf4d0031405bc7.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"Sanitize + Allergen\",\"Copy\":\"This industry-first cycle sanitizes fabrics to kill 99% of common bacteria and allergens such as dust mites.\"},{\"Feature\":\"Dynamic Balancing Technology (dBT\u2122)\",\"Copy\":\"Our patented time saving technology senses and rebalances uneven loads during the spin cycle, providing a quiet wash.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--MHF00Vd7--/82ab364c61595de42f2e5cbdaf7d9f10455fdbb0.jpg\",\"Video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UxPUeh6toTs\"},{\"Feature\":\"Reversible Door\",\"Copy\":\"Easily reverse your washer and dryer door for superior installation flexibility.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--7jqfs7dn--/3c9fcc1872a1236895f19502172c87829b892a6c.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"PowerSteam\",\"Copy\":\"Steam safely penetrates deep into fabric fibers, loosening stains and delivering enhanced cleaning performance.\",\"Image\":\"https://images.salsify.com/image/upload/s--LAW2EOyC--/9dae2446e3e77f85476fc7cfa8f358396056fb39.jpg\"},{\"Feature\":\"More Energy Efficient -Tier 2 Certified\",\"Copy\":\"This ENERGY STAR certified clothes washer also meets CEE Tier 2 specifications. Save on utility costs and reduce your environmental impact with our eco-friendly design. Experience efficient washing without compromisin